      "name": "Overwhelming Ectoplasm",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "An ectoplasmic amalgam's Strikes affect incorporeal creatures with the effects of a Ghost Touch property rune. A creature damaged by an ectoplasmic amalgam's Strikes is Stunned 1 unless they succeed at a DC 36 Fortitude save save, as the thoughts and emotions of the amalgam's constituent souls invade their mind.",
