      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Pummeling Barrage",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The ectoplasmic amalgam attempts a melee Strike against each enemy within the amalgam's melee reach. Each attack counts toward the amalgam's multiple attack penalty but don't increase the amalgam's penalty until it has made all its attacks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Spew Ectoplasm",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "The ectoplasmic amalgam releases a burst of ectoplasm that deals 16d6 bludgeoning damage in a 60-foot cone (DC 36 basic Reflex save). On a failed save, a creature is additionally Stunned 1 (or Stunned 2 on a critical failure). Spew Ectoplasm functions as a force effect for the purposes of affecting incorporeal creatures. The ectoplasmic amalgam can't use Spew Ectoplasm again for 1d4 rounds."
